    "accessibility": {
      "short": "A dot-painted scene of people relaxing in a sunny riverside park with trees, boats, and dogs.",
      "long": "A horizontally oriented painting executed entirely in small, unmixed colored dots. In the foreground, several figures sit and lie on green grass, including a man in a top hat holding a cane, a woman in black, and two dogs—one black, one small and brown. A woman in a dark dress and hat stands at right holding a black parasol. Midground features more figures: women in long dresses with parasols (red, blue), children, and seated groups. Background shows leafy trees, a calm river with white-sailed boats, and distant figures along the far bank. Light comes from upper left, casting diagonal shadows across the lawn.",
